<title>ITALY: Gross yield 6.72 pct on 3-month Italian T-bills.</title>
<headline>Gross yield 6.72 pct on 3-month Italian T-bills.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Auction results for the sale of 31.75 trillion lire of three, six and 12-month short-term Treasury bills (BOTs).</p>
<p>		 Gross yield  (last)    Avge price   (last)</p>
<p>    3-month     6.72	(6.03)    98.30	  (98.52)</p>
<p>    6-month     6.61	(6.00)    96.74	  (97.08)</p>
<p>    1-year	6.86	(6.55)    93.55	  (93.85)</p>
<p>Note: results compared with a previous auction on April 10.</p>
</text>
